    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAMSUMO</strong> is an indie physics-based multiplayer game where up to 4 players can duke it out in the world's most adorable battle arena! Choose from a selection of <strong>cute</strong>, <u>cool</u>, and <i>kooky</i> hamsters to <strong>BONK YOUR FRIENDS</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561810/extras/142b287029b85b7da706d918befa4214.poster.avif?t=1755046323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561810/extras/142b287029b85b7da706d918befa4214.webm?t=1755046323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561810/extras/142b287029b85b7da706d918befa4214.mp4?t=1755046323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>GO HAM</strong> with a hamster that fits your style! Choose from 8 playable HamSumo fighters, each with their own look and personality!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unleash the power of the cosmos with <strong>STAR MOVES</strong>! Each hamster has 3 unique Star Moves to experiment with. Learning to use them effectively can really turn the tables on your opponents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep physics-based movement that is <strong>EASY TO LEARN</strong> and <strong>HARD TO MASTER</strong>! Whether you learn best in Practice Mode or in the heat of battle in Versus Mode, honing your roly-poly skills will be the difference between victory and defeat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play against your friends in <strong>VERSUS</strong> matches! 1v1, 2v2, or a full on 4-Player Free For All? The choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Captain Ham's perilous journey to Planet Sumo in <strong>ADVENTURE</strong> mode! Play through a full campaign of single-player levels and bonk your way through the story of HamSumo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong> your experience with unlockable accessories for your hamsters!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAMSUMO</strong> is an indie physics-based multiplayer game where up to 4 players can duke it out in the world's most adorable battle arena! Choose from a selection of <strong>cute</strong>, <u>cool</u>, and <i>kooky</i> hamsters to <strong>BONK YOUR FRIENDS</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561810/extras/142b287029b85b7da706d918befa4214.poster.avif?t=1755046323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561810/extras/142b287029b85b7da706d918befa4214.webm?t=1755046323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561810/extras/142b287029b85b7da706d918befa4214.mp4?t=1755046323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>GO HAM</strong> with a hamster that fits your style! Choose from 8 playable HamSumo fighters, each with their own look and personality!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unleash the power of the cosmos with <strong>STAR MOVES</strong>! Each hamster has 3 unique Star Moves to experiment with. Learning to use them effectively can really turn the tables on your opponents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep physics-based movement that is <strong>EASY TO LEARN</strong> and <strong>HARD TO MASTER</strong>! Whether you learn best in Practice Mode or in the heat of battle in Versus Mode, honing your roly-poly skills will be the difference between victory and defeat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play against your friends in <strong>VERSUS</strong> matches! 1v1, 2v2, or a full on 4-Player Free For All? The choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Captain Ham's perilous journey to Planet Sumo in <strong>ADVENTURE</strong> mode! Play through a full campaign of single-player levels and bonk your way through the story of HamSumo!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong> your experience with unlockable accessories for your hamsters!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "BONK YOUR FRIENDS in this action-packed, roly-poly, multiplayer action game! Choose your favorite HamSumo fighter to duke it out with your friends in this adorable PvP arena! Unleash unique and powerful Star Moves to blast away the competition and show the world your Sumo Spirit!",
